MODULE: HorizonPredatesTerminal
TARGET: HorizonAfterTerminal
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the horizon uses stale pre-prepare heads rather than the post-terminal head vector
PERTURBS: CaptureHorizon

--- FIND
    /\ horizon' = length /\ horizonWal' = wal
--- REPLACE
    /\ horizon' = Zero /\ horizonWal' = wal
--- END
